<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000115> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000178> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000115> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000129> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "b has member part c =Def c member part of b"@en .
