<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000121> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000139> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "b has temporal part c =Def c temporal part of b"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Your life has temporal part the first year of your life"@en .
