<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/AcceptanceDecisionSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionSpecification> .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/AcceptanceDecisionSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A decision specificaiton that specifies that some proposition in a binary decision is to be carried out"@en .
