<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/CognitiveProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mental process that brings into being, sustains, or modifies a cognitive representation."@en .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/CognitiveProcess> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Domain/CognitiveProcessOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
