<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/CognitiveRepresentationFormation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/CognitiveProcess> .
