<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/ConfidenceValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mental quality that, when fused with a cognitive representation (CR), determines the extent to which a cognitive system operates as if CR is veridical."@en .
