<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/ConstraintSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/ObjectiveSpecification> .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/ConstraintSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An objective specification that specifies a set of limitations on the possible states of some entity."@en .
