<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Decision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Decision"@en .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Decision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/CognitiveProcess> .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a decision process is a process in which some agent or aggregate of agents having the role of a decision maker indicate a preference towards an option or bundle of options belonging to a set of possible alternatives"@en .
