<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionAlternative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Decision Alternative"@en .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionAlternative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Classification> .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionAlternative> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a decision alternative is a classification that indicates some entity is to be considered as a possible choice in a decision described in a decision process plan"@en .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionAlternative> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/UMassCenterforeDesign/decision-making/master/decision_core.owl"@en .
