<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionPlanSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a decision plan specification is a plan specification that indicates how a decision will be executed, the alternatives that will be considered,  the criteria by which they will judged, and the preferences for those criteria"@en .
