<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A directive information content entity that indicates the results of a decision (occurrent) wherein one option is selected from some set of possible alternatives"@en .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DecisionSpecification> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/UMassCenterforeDesign/decision-making/master/decision_core.owl"@en .
