<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DirectRepresentation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "x is a Representation that is Warranted in some subject s & x is_about y & x comes into existence, as a result of a causal process initiated by y and in a way appropriate to y, in the cognitive system of s."@en .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/DirectRepresentation> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1515/regular10.pdf"@en .
