<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/IdentificationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Propspective Cognitive Process that has a Comparing Process and a Reasoning Process as subprocesses and realizes a Belief Disposition the realization of which is the formation of a Belief Representation about whether some Cognitive Representations are about the same entity."@en .
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/IdentificationProcess> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Domain/CognitiveProcessOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
