<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000014> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ArtifactOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000015> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
