<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Long Gun that fires packets of shot, a single slug, a sabot, or a specialty round (such as tear gas, bolo shell, or a breaching round) over shorter ranges than that of Rifles and with less accuracy."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000015> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Shotgun&oldid=1062571691"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
