<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000137> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deposit_(bank)" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000137> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
