<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Group of Persons forming the total population of some Government Domain."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000141> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Population&oldid=1059148871"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000141> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
