<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Temporal Interval that is based on the approximate length of time required for a Natural Satellite to complete one cycle of its rotational motion around its Primary Body."@en .
