<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Artifact Function that is realized during events in which an Artifact is used to interfere with the transmission of information for the purpose of preventing communication."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000273> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ArtifactOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
