<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000313> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Assuming a non-dispersive media, the Wavelength will be the inverse of the Frequency."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000313> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wavelength"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000313> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000752> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000313> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Wave Process Profile that is the distance the Wave Process traverses during one Wave Cycle."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000313> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
