<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000366> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000366> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Information Processing"@en .
