<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Measurement Unit that is used as a standard for measurement of the Amount of work that is available in an object."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "ft-lbs, calorie, horsepower, kilowatt" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000444> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/UnitsOfMeasureOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
