<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000449> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Comment: Remuneration normally consists of salary or hourly wages, but also applies to commission, stock options, fringe benefits, etc."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000449> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Remuneration"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000449> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001334> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Purchasing wherein a Financial Instrument is used by an Agent (the Employer) to compensate another Agent (the Employee) for the services they perform for the Employer."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000449> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Remuneration&oldid=1033306001"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
