<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Change in which an Independent Continuant becomes the bearer or carrier of some Dependent Continuant."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000554> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
