<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000557> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stasis of Non-Mission Capable"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000557> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001132> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Stasis of Mission Capability during which the participating Continuant is not capable of performing any of its primary functions for the specified Mission."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000557> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
