<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Wave Process in which an Electromagnetic Wave with a Visible Light Frequency is reflected off a portion of matter."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000558> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
