<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "a top spinning in place" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "adjusting your posture" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "raising your left arm" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "swivelling your office chair to face the window" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000584> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
