<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Trueness Measurement"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Veracity Measurement"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Measurement Information Content Entity that is a measurement of the extent to which a description conforms to the reality it describes."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000592> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
