<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000600> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Service Artifact Function that is realized in processes of giving legal advice to clients drafting legal documents for clients and representing clients in legal negotiations and court proceedings such as lawsuits."@en .
