<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Disposition that is realized when its bearer exerts a magnetic force on another entity."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000632> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/QualityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
