<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Portion of Propellant that is stored in a gaseous state."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000637> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ArtifactOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
