<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Engine that is designed to convert thermal energy into mechanical energy."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000638> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ArtifactOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000639> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000639> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mine"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000639> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000192> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Facility that is designed to support the extraction of minerals or other geological materials from an orebody, lode, vein, seam, reef, or placer deposit within the earth."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000639> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mining&oldid=1062844924"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000639> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/FacilityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
