<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000641> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Entertainment Facility"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000641> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000192> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Facility that is designed to host activities that are intended to hold the interest of, or give pleasure or delight to, an audience."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000641> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Entertainment&oldid=1061851778"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000641> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/FacilityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
