<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Fiat Surface that divides the spheroid composed of Earth and its atmosphere at some point that corresponds to the mean level of calm water in the Earth’s oceans."@en .
