<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Parabolic Dish"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Radio Antenna that uses a parabolic reflector to direct or receive radio waves and has a very high gain."@en .
