<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000725> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wedding"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000725> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000455> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Act of Wedding Ceremony"@en .
