<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000737> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000483> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Forward Operating Base"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Military Base that is located relatively close to an offensive Area of Operations, is supported by the Base of Operations, and is designed to support local strategic objectives and tactical operations."@en .
