<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Poison Artifact Function that is realized in a process which causes illness in, or the death of, a living thing that is detrimental to humans or human concerns."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000828> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://www.dictionary.com/browse/pesticide" .
