<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000897> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Oxidizers are essential participants in many processes including combustion and rusting. Hence, a portion of oxidizer must always be present along with a portion of fuel in order for combustion to occur."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000897> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Portion of Oxidizer"@en .
