<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Portion of Oxidizing Agent"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Portion of Material that is disposed to steal electrons from other substances (i.e. to oxidize other substances) as a participant in a reduction-oxidation process."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "oxygen, hydrogen peroxide, chlorine, sulfiric acid, potassium nitrate" .
