<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Measurement Unit that is used as a standard for measurement of the number of times an event repeats per unit of time."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "hertz, revolutions per minute" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000959> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/UnitsOfMeasureOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
