<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Measurement Information Content Entity that consists of a symbol that places an Entity into some rank order."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The sentence \"The coldest day in history in Chicago, IL. is January 20, 1985.\" is the carrier of an ordinal measurment."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "a measurement that places Geospatial Regions into a rank order of small, medium, large" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "a measurement that places military units onto a readiness rank order of red, yellow, green" .
