<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Acceleration of an object relative to a free-fall, or inertial, observer who is momentarily at rest relative to the object being measured (hence, gravity does not cause Proper Acceleration)."@en .
