<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001128> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000676> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Inhabitancy in which a Person lives in a dwelling permanently or for an extended period of time."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001128> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://www.thefreedictionary.com/reside" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001128> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001129> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Pressurization Control Artifact Function"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000113> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Ventilation Control Artifact Function that is realized by processes in which some Artifact is used to control the partial pressure of air in some space."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001129> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ArtifactOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001130> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001130> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Geospatial Polygon"@en .
