<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Geospatial Line String that has at least three vertices where the connecting lines form a closed loop."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001130> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/GeospatialOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001131> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001131> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EAN-8 Barcode"@en .
