<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Reliability Measurement"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Measurement Information Content Entity that is a measurement of the extent to which an entity can consistently produce an outcome."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Reliability concerns both a measure of past performance and the expectation that future performance will conform to the range of past performances."@en .
