<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001538> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/UnitsOfMeasureOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
