<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001628> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Yankee Time Zone is the same local time as Mike Time Zone, but is 1 Day (i.e. 24 Hours) behind Mike Time Zone as they are on opposite sides of the International Date Line."@en .
