<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001779> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has inside instant"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001779> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000148> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001779> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001848> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "For Temporal Interval t1 and Temporal Instant t2, t1 has inside instant t2 if and only if there exists Temporal Instants t3 and t4 that are part of t1 and non-identical with t2, such that t3 is before t2 and t4 is after t2."@en .
