<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001795> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000038> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001795> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has inside interval"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001795> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000038> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001795> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001924> .
