<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001818> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001819> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001819> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000003> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001819> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "caused by"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001819> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000003> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001819> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "x caused_by y iff x and y are instances of Occurrent, and x is a consequence of y."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001819> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ExtendedRelationOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001820> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001820> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has granddaughter"@en .
