<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001852> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "accessory in"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001852> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001852> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001852> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001949> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "y is_accessory_in x iff x is an instance of Process and y is an instance of Agent, such that y assists another agent in the commission of x, and y was not located at the location of x when x occurred, and y was not an agent_in x."@en .
