<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001859> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001864> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An instance of Organization o1 is_delimited_by some Delimiting Domain dd1 iff dd1 is the area within which o1 can legally operate."@en .
