<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001861> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is material of"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001861> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001861> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001991> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An object m is material of an object o when m is the material of which o consists and that material does not undergo a change of kind during the creation of o"@en .
