<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001863> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "uses measurement unit"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001863> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000120> .
