<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001863> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001961> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "y uses_measurement_unit x iff y is an instance of Information Bearing Entity and x is an instance of Measurement Unit, such that x describes the magnitude of measured physical quantity mentioned in y."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001863> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
