<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001872> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001873> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001873> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "See notes for inverse property." .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001873> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "represented by"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001873> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001069> .
