<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "y represented_by x iff x is an instance of Information Content Entity, and y is an instance of Entity, and z is carrier of x, such that x is about y in virtue of there existing an isomorphism between characteristics of z and y."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001873> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001874> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001874> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000008> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001874> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is temporal region of"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001874> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:commonb105 .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "t is temporal region of p iff p occupies temporal region t."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Leaving this is in ERO for now since BFO2020 has no inverse of occupies-temporal-region yet."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001874> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ExtendedRelationOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001875> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
