<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001879> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "designated by"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001879> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000686> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001879> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001801> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001879> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001916> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "x designated_by y iff y is an instance of Information Content Entity and x is an instance of Entity, such that given some context, y uniquely distinguishes x from other entities."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001879> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
