<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An agent a1 is accomplice_in some Processual Entity p1 iff a1 assists in the commission of p1, is located at the location of p1, but is not agent_in p1."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001895> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Accomplice&oldid=1002047204"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
