<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001899> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001976> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "x language_used_by y iff y is an instance of Information Bearing Entity and x is an instance of Language, such that the literal value of y is a string that is encoded according to the syntax of x."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001899> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
