<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "x has_accessory y iff x is an instance of Process and y is an instance of Agent, such that y assists another agent in the commission of x, and y was not located at the location of x when x occurred, and y was not an agent_in x."@en .
