<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001951> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001951> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has subordinate role"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001951> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "For all x,y,t: x has subordinate role y at t iff: x is an instance of Role at time t, and y is an instance of Role at time t, and there is some z such that x is realized by z and z is an instance of Process which creates, modifies, transfers, or eliminates some u such that u is a Process Regulation at time t, and u is addressed to the bearer of y."@en .
